                        <characteristic typeId="ct-CmdUnit-Trait" name="Trait">&quot;Otherwise Engaged; Appointed governor of the Leeward Islands in 1814, Leith is focused on suppressing Napoléon’s supporters there through 1815. Unavailable after January 1814.
Flirts with Death; -1 in Leader Fate, +2 if Harmed, 1812, 1813.&quot;</characteristic>
